    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/6663f85a41f1a28a2cdc552d/E4I2MTLJZcJItn0G_kmx3.png) ⟨28⟩\nWTForbes⟨28⟩\n/\nfin_1⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nModalities:  Tabular ⟨30⟩ Text ⟨31⟩\nFormats:  json ⟨32⟩\nSize:  100K - 1M ⟨33⟩\nLibraries:  Datasets ⟨34⟩ Dask ⟨35⟩\nCroissant\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Data Studio ⟨36⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨37⟩ Community ⟨38⟩\n##  You need to agree to share your contact information to access this dataset\nThis repository is publicly accessible, but you have to accept the conditions to access its files and content.\nLog in⟨39⟩ or Sign Up⟨40⟩ to review the conditions and access this dataset content.\n**YAML Metadata Warning:** empty or missing yaml metadata in repo card\nCheck out the documentation⟨41⟩ for more information.\n  * Upload Status⟨42⟩\n  * Method⟨43⟩\n  * Directory Layout⟨44⟩\n  * Notes⟨45⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨46⟩ WTForbes/fin_1 \n##   ⟨42⟩ Upload Status \n  * repo_created: yes\n  * gated_access: user will configure in Hugging Face UI\n  * corpus_jsonl: generated by `prepare_zh_hf_upload.py`\n  * needs_audio_upload: true\n\n\n##   ⟨43⟩ Method \n  * Source rows are selected only from zh-CN/zh-TW JSONL files.\n  * Audio is uploaded only if its exact path appears in the selected JSONL rows.\n  * The source audio directory is never uploaded wholesale.\n  * Shared zh-CN/zh-TW repos use a union of referenced audio paths.\n  * The same referenced audio path maps to the same deterministic audio_id.\n  * WAV input must be converted to FLAC before being written into Parquet.\n  * Existing FLAC/MP3/Opus/Ogg keep their codec unless changed later.\n\n\n##   ⟨44⟩ Directory Layout \n\n```\ncorpus_dir_jsonl/\n  train.jsonl\n  train_stage1.jsonl\n  eval.jsonl\nmanifests/\n  audio_manifest.tsv\n  set_summary.tsv\n  upload_progress.json\n\n```\n\n##   ⟨45⟩ Notes \nNew audio repo for filtered_audio_fineweb_1.\nKnown external pending item: `WTForbes/unc_5` is not present on this machine and is intentionally skipped.\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    21\nTotal file size: 93.9 GB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨47⟩ Privacy⟨48⟩ About⟨49⟩ Careers⟨50⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
